{"id":"n62370-2-11","stage":2,"title":"비키다 · 让开","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62370-2-11-1","ko":"길 앞에다 차를 세워 두면 어떻게 합니까?","zh":"怎么能把车停在路口挡着呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"길","meaning":"路，道，道路","explanation":"길：路，道，道路。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"1","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}},{"text":"앞에다","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；에다：表示放置、添加或作用的位置；相当于强调的 에。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞에다","audio":"/audio/84f4fc90ef5820adceeb.mp3"}},{"text":"차를","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차를","audio":"/audio/c9101b9a3fcbc9e75de1.mp3"}},{"text":"세워","meaning":"停放（车辆）","explanation":"세우다：停放（车辆）；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"세우다","audio":"/audio/23575e84cdfb112c017e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58163","senseId":"15","lemma":"세우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세워","audio":"/audio/5a60fda2ee03938e7459.mp3"}},{"text":"두면","meaning":"做好后保持结果（-아/어 두다）","explanation":"차를 세워 두다 指把车停在那里并保持停放状态；-면 引出受到责备的行为。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48279","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두면","audio":"/audio/2eacfbaa050f1bbdc9b8.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"합니까?","meaning":"做、处理（어떻게 합니까：怎么能这样）","explanation":"어떻게 합니까 是 어떻게 하다 的正式礼貌疑问形式；本句责备把车停在挡路的位置，不能删去实义 하다 只解释为疑问语尾。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"합니까","audio":"/audio/572c42e432d9ac832188.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路，道，道路","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"供人或车等通行的，以一定宽度延伸的长长的地面上空间。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"23575e84cdfb112c","term":"세우다","zh":"停放（车辆）","audio":"/audio/23575e84cdfb112c017e.mp3","entryId":"58163","definition":"停放（车辆）","pronunciation":["세우다"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"做好后保持结果（-아/어 두다）","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"48279","definition":"做好后保持结果（-아/어 두다）","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做、处理（어떻게 합니까：怎么能这样）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做、处理（어떻게 합니까：怎么能这样）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e42960db992e0d2e9a62.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62370-2-11-2","ko":"금방 차 비켜 드릴게요.","zh":"我马上把车挪开。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"금방","meaning":"马上，立马","explanation":"금방：马上，立马。","readings":[{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34764","senseId":"2","lemma":"금방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}},{"text":"차","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}},{"text":"비켜","meaning":"让开，回避","explanation":"비키다：让开，回避；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"비키다","audio":"/audio/bcd25b28e527e71363e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62370","senseId":"2","lemma":"비키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비켜","audio":"/audio/2988ce57006642cf8b7a.mp3"}},{"text":"드릴게요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","explanation":"드리다：为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59252","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드릴게요","audio":"/audio/e61f9f5edc04f979cd3a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08c341712591f51e","term":"금방","zh":"马上，立马","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3","entryId":"34764","definition":"就现在，立刻。","pronunciation":["금방"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"bcd25b28e527e713","term":"비키다","zh":"让开，回避","audio":"/audio/bcd25b28e527e71363e8.mp3","entryId":"62370","definition":"为不碰面或不撞到而稍稍改变方向。","pronunciation":["비ː키다"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"59252","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","pronunciation":["드리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5f13af7c7cfb2c0faa1b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.51,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/Sea